'''Gold Synthwave''' is a [[Unique Weapons|Unique]] knife obtained by finishing 1st on the tokens collecting leaderboard {{Currency|Beach Ball}} during the [[Summer Event 2025]].

== Appearance ==
'''Gold Synthwave''' is the Ancient variation of [[Synthwave]] Evo knife, but colored with a yellow border and a gold-to-black gradient.

== Trivia ==

* The sole owner of this weapon is [https://www.roblox.com/users/1443123347/profile SnakeKing0705].


